        <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M7 16l-4-4m0 0l-4 4m4-4h18"/></svg>
        All articles
